NAME: an imp for the tiny hill
DESCRIPTION: (hill tiny): the ;redcode-tiny line and an ;assert of tiny's core and length, which 94b's settings reject; see behtests/hill_tiny_imp.beh
SRC:
(program
  (hill tiny)
  (MOV (Dir 0) (Dir 1)))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-tiny
;assert CORESIZE==800 && MAXLENGTH==20

  MOV.I  $0     , $1     
  DAT    $0     , $0     